              "content": "=Act as a professional Customer Relations Specialist. Write a concise, high-end, and professional \"Thank You for Contacting Us\" email response.\n\nFollow these rules strictly:\n1. Start directly with the main email body (e.g., \"Dear [Username],\"). Do not include a subject line, pre-text, greeting commentary, or intros like \"Here is the email:\".\n2. End the email exactly with \"Best regards,\\nYour Name\". Do not add any conversational sign-offs, follow-ups, or notes after this signature.\n3. The tone must be premium, polite, and reassuring.\n4. Acknowledge that we have received their message and that a senior team member is already reviewing their specific inquiry.\n\nUse these exact placeholder variables for the dynamic data:\n- User's Name: [{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.name }}]\n- User's Message: [{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.message }}]"
